<title>ISRAEL: Israel Oil Refineries Q3 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Israel Oil Refineries Q3 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil Refineries Ltd, 74 percent owned by the state of Israel and 26 percent owned by the Israel Corp.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			   Q3 96	Q3 95	9-MTH 96   9-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		  1,521,188  1,530,010  4,633,283  4,810,497</p>
<p>Operating profit	   1,252     58,601     37,640    137,775</p>
<p>Net Profit	    loss 6,672     29,428	1,656     81,082</p>
<p>The company attributed the loss to a reduction in refining, an erosion in the exchange rate and a decline in the price of petrochemical products.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
